---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Quality & Safety Standards | Sunrise Gases" description="Quality control and safety standards at Sunrise Gases. We follow strict manufacturing, handling, and safety protocols for all industrial and specialty gases.">
  <article class="page">
    <header class="page-hero">
      <h1 class="page-title">Quality &amp; Safety</h1>
    </header>

    <section class="page-section">
      <h2 class="section-title">Quality control</h2>
      <p class="page-text">Every gas cylinder we supply undergoes purity verification and pressure testing before dispatch. Our filling and handling procedures follow established industrial gas standards to ensure consistent product quality.</p>
      <p class="page-text">We maintain documentation for batch traceability and can provide certificates of analysis on request.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section">
      <h2 class="section-title">Safety</h2>
      <p class="page-text">Safety is integral to our operations. We follow proper handling, storage, and transport protocols for compressed and liquefied gases. Safety Data Sheets (SDS) are available for every product we supply.</p>
      <p class="page-text">Our cylinders are tested and maintained in accordance with regulatory requirements. Customers receive handling and storage guidance with every delivery.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section">
      <h2 class="section-title">Downloads</h2>
      <p class="page-text">Safety Data Sheets for each gas are available on the individual product pages. Contact us if you need specific documentation or certification.</p>
      <a href="/gases/" class="page-link">View product pages →</a>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    max-width: var(--space-container);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-section) 1.5rem;
  }
  .page-hero {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--text-hero);
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .page-section {
    padding: 2rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .page-section:last-of-type {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--text-h2);
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .page-text {
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .page-text:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .page-link {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .page-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
